*.zip

# R50's factory audio is deliberately NOT tracked. It was ~68 MB across 378
# WAVs, which every clone would pay for forever, so it was removed from
# history. The JSON manifests that map and tune the samples are still source
# and still tracked -- only the audio itself lives outside the repository.
#
# Consequence: a fresh clone has the manifests but no audio, so R50's shipped
# multisample tests in Tests/test_r50.cpp will fail until the sample tree is
# restored into Products/R50/factory_samples and Products/R50/Samples.

# Editor backup files
*~